        "text": "I'd rather be a hammer than a nail... »\" ... takes a deep breath, and suddenly rips the entire toenail off. This causes a chain reaction. She twists away in pain, and knocks the giant back-pack over."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 772,
        "text": "How wild it was, to let it be. » Cheryl touches the bridge and smiles. Her eyes fill with tears. Simon and Garfunkel start to sing El Condor Pasa."
      }
